# When Borg Queen enters, it assimilates a creature card from an opponent's graveyard (CR 122.6, 205.1b, 614.12).
# Bot2 mills Memnite and Ornithopter with Thought Scour, two creature cards, so the target question is actually asked
# (CR 603.3d); the Thought Scour in that same graveyard is a sorcery card and so no target at all (CR 115.1). The
# Memnite is the one taken: it arrives under Bot1 with a +1/+1 counter, a Borg artifact creature, getting her +2/+0.

